OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped and strangled woman
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and strangled a woman
OL,7,Fbefore putting pressure on her to
OL,8,Fwithdraw her police statement has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said Jayden
OL,12,FThorpe, 25, of Kirklington Road,
OL,13,FRainworth, subjected the woman to a
OL,14,F"catalogue of abuse" throughout 2024
OL,15,Fand 2025.
OL,17,FHe raped and strangled her on separate
OL,18,Foccasions, and subjected her to a
OL,19,F"campaign of controlling and coercive
OL,20,Fbehaviour", the force added.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
