OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped and strangled woman
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThorpe was found guilty of rape,
OL,7,Fintentional strangulation, engaging in
OL,8,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour, and
OL,9,Fperverting the course of justice, and
OL,10,Fwas jailed for eight years at
OL,11,FNottingham Crown Court on Tuesday.
